# A potted plant, for the corners of the CENTRE's waiting room.
#
# Y is up, +Z is north, one world unit is one map tile. The lowest vertex sits
# on y = 0 and the model is centred on x = 0 and z = 0, so the game places it
# by its feet.
#
# Faces are wound so that (c - a) x (b - a) points out of the solid, which is
# what tools/obj2cpp.py bakes as the face normal. Get it backwards and the
# model still draws, it just goes flat ambient dark.
#
# A pot and a three sided crown of leaves, 10 triangles, 0.95 units tall. It
# blocks its tile, which is what keeps the corners of the room from being
# somewhere to stand and stare at a wall.

mtllib plant.mtl

# the pot
v -0.26 0.00 -0.26
v  0.26 0.00 -0.26
v  0.26 0.00  0.26
v -0.26 0.00  0.26
v -0.30 0.34 -0.30
v  0.30 0.34 -0.30
v  0.30 0.34  0.30
v -0.30 0.34  0.30

# the crown
v  0.00 0.95  0.00
v -0.42 0.40  0.24
v  0.42 0.40  0.24
v  0.00 0.40 -0.48

usemtl plant_pot
f 5 6 7 8
f 1 2 6 5
f 2 3 7 6
f 4 1 5 8

usemtl plant_leaf
f 9 10 11
f 9 11 12
f 9 12 10
